---
/**
 * Sample-data warning.
 *
 * Rendered by the layout from a single dataset flag, so it cannot be omitted
 * from one page by forgetting to add it. Not dismissible, and it reserves its
 * own height in normal flow so it causes no layout shift. A notice on the tint
 * ladder with an ink label: DESIGN.md has no warning colour.
 */
---

<div class="wrap">
  <p class="notice preview" role="status">
    <span class="badge badge-ink">Preview</span>
    <span>
      Sample data, not real predictions. Every probability on this site is generated for layout
      purposes.
    </span>
  </p>
</div>

<style>
  .preview {
    margin: var(--space-sm) auto 0;
    max-width: none;
    align-items: center;
  }
</style>
